@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
title Neo4j catalog - current source mapping, not a live capture
class JobPosition
class TargetRole
class Level {
  actual member ID / duration
}
class Competency
class MicroSkill {
  organizationId / version
  provisionMode
  per-knowledge outcome code lists
}
class LearningModule {
  knowledgeLevel / skillVersion
  outcomeCodes / contentVersion
}
class Certificate {
  organizationId / knowledgeLevel
  skillVersion / outcomeCodes
  version / HTTPS referenceUrl
}
JobPosition --> TargetRole : HAS_ROLE
TargetRole --> Level : HAS_LEVEL
Level --> Competency : HAS_COMPETENCY
Competency --> MicroSkill : HAS_SKILL
Level --> MicroSkill : REQUIRES_SKILL\nrequiredKnowledgeLevels
LearningModule "many" --> "one" MicroSkill : TEACHES
MicroSkill --> MicroSkill : HAS_SKILL_PREREQUISITE\nexact knowledge pair
MicroSkill --> Certificate : REQUIRES_CERTIFICATE\none active configured pair
note bottom of MicroSkill : Catalog only. PostgreSQL owns learner state and evidence.
@enduml
